### Database Seeding
#### [NEW] `seed-assets.ts`
Will seed representative assets mapping to the length-based validation constraints:
- `WAGON` variants: 11 numeric digits.
- `LOCO` variants: 5 numeric digits.
- `CRANE`: 6 numeric digits.
- `8W_DETC`: 6 numeric digits.
- `4W_DHTC`: 3 numeric digits.

We will also update `seed-asset-categories.ts` (if needed) to ensure `checkDigit: false` is explicitly set where applicable.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Valid 11-digit numeric Wagon numbers will succeed.
- Registering a 5-digit Loco will succeed.
- Attempting to register an 11-character Wagon with alphanumeric characters will fail (Type: NUMERIC).
- Attempting to register a 10-digit or 12-digit Wagon number will fail (Length: 11).
- Attempting to use a GROUP location will fail.
- Attempting to use a mismatching pipeline location will fail.
